<title>USA: Tech Electro to buy stake in broker-dealer.</title>
<headline>Tech Electro to buy stake in broker-dealer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tech Electro Industries Inc said late Tuesday that it has entered into a non-binding letter of intent to acquire a controlling interest in Nichols, Safina, Lerner &amp; Co, a broker-dealer with offices in New York, Florida and California.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available for details.</p>
</text>
